#ffi test


Server init.

ፕሮግራም የትውስታ-አስተዳደር: 4.

# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := ፕሮግራም ቅንብር: ['FFITESTLIB'].



Server አያይዝ: (
 ሰልፍ አዲስ ;
 libname ;
 ['puts'] ;
 ( ሰልፍ አዲስ ; ['pointer'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Puts'] ;
 ['str:']
).

>> s := Blob utf8: ['Hello from FFI!\n'].

Puts str: s.
s ልቀቅ.

# test with struct

>> a := Blob አዲስ: 8.
a bytes: (
	ሰልፍ <<: 
	2, ; 0 ; 0 ; 0 ;
    1  ; 0 ; 0 ; 0
).

>> struct := Blob struct: (ሰልፍ <<: ['int'], ; ['int']).

Server አያይዝ: (
	ሰልፍ <<: ['@structtest'], ;
	['@structtest'] ;
	(ሰልፍ <<: struct) ; 
	['int'] ;	
	['ffitest'] ;
	['ffisum:']
).
	
ውጤት ፃፍ: ['Sum test:'] + (ffitest ffisum: a), አዲስ-መስመር.

struct struct-ልቀቅ.
struct ልቀቅ.
a ልቀቅ.
